# C style for the firmware patch, tuned to the existing patch/navigation.c layout:
# 4-space indent, 100 columns, right-aligned pointers, one-line guards. The tree is formatted
# with clang-format 18.
#
# tools/format.sh formats tools/build.py's NAVIGATION, tools/peq.py's UI_SOURCES but the files
# its UNFORMATTED names (upstream's, written before this file, kept as upstream writes them), and
# the headers it names. The vendored patch/monocypher/ is never formatted.
#
# Do not run clang-format on patch/trampoline.S, patch/link.ld or patch/contexts.inc:
# it cannot parse GAS or linker scripts, and it packs contexts.inc onto few lines.
---
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
IndentWidth: 4
ColumnLimit: 100
PointerAlignment: Right
BreakBeforeBraces: Attach
Cpp11BracedListStyle: false
AllowShortIfStatementsOnASingleLine: WithoutElse
AllowShortLoopsOnASingleLine: true
AllowShortBlocksOnASingleLine: Always
